	The current hack at UT for wishes is:

	Wish for a blessed magic lamp.  Rub it, wish for another, and drop the
old one.  Repeat until you have a pile of at least 50 used lamps.

	With the last lamp wish for a blessed wand of polymorph.  Zap the
pile of lamps, then rummuge through the pile.

	You are now looking for two things: containers to loot (newly created
bags, boxes and chests have new items in them), and more blessed magic lamps.
After shifting through the pile, zap it again (be sure and pick up any wands
of polymorph you find), until you get bored.

	You should wind up with everything plus lots of wishes to tide you
over.

